    "caption": "📣 Apple Representatives Visited Astana Hub! 🍏\n\nWe were honored to host Esra Koni (META & RCIS Public Policy and Government Affairs) and Olga Terekhova (Digital Policy for META & RCIS) from Apple at Astana Hub this Thursday.\n\n🤝 During their visit, we showcased our achievements at the Apple Authorized Training Centre (AATCE) and delved into the dynamic app developer ecosystem in Kazakhstan. \n\n⚡️ Our discussions emphasized the burgeoning potential of Kazakhstan’s digital landscape, exploring app development growth and exciting export opportunities.",
